      <h2>Google Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        This site uses Google Analytics 4 (GA4), a web analytics service provided by
        Google LLC, to understand how visitors use the site and to improve it. GA4
        collects aggregate usage data such as pages visited, approximate location
        (derived from IP address, at city/country level), device/browser type, screen
        size, referral source, time on site, and interactions (for example starting
        a download or downloading a ZIP archive).
      </p>
      <p>
        We use Google Consent Mode v2: analytics cookies and identifiers are <em>not</em>
        activated until you explicitly accept analytics in the consent banner shown on
        the site. If you reject, Google Analytics tracking is disabled for your
        browser. You can change your choice at any time by clearing your browser’s
        local storage for this site.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Google Analytics uses cookies and similar identifiers to measure usage.</li>
        <li>Your website URL submissions, private session tokens, email addresses, raw error messages, and ZIP filenames are never sent to Google Analytics.</li>
        <li>You can learn how Google uses data from sites/apps that use Google Analytics at <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google’s partner-sites policy</a>.</li>
        <li>You can control or delete Google Analytics cookies via your browser settings and via <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google’s Analytics opt-out browser add-on</a>.</li>
        <li>See <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/cookies" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google’s Cookie policy</a> for details on cookies used by Google.</li>
